4" end="00:42.544">then </span><span begin="00:43.168" end="00:43.320">you're </span><span begin="00:43.320" end="00:43.552">a </span><span begin="00:43.552" end="00:44.752">loner</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.025" end="00:47.744"><span begin="00:46.025" end="00:46.152">So </span><span begin="00:46.152" end="00:46.344">you </span><span begin="00:46.344" end="00:46.728">see </span><span begin="00:46.728" end="00:47.744">her</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.104" end="00:51.432"><span begin="00:48.104" end="00:48.376">She's </span><span begin="00:48.376" end="00:49.416">over </span><span begin="00:49.704" end="00:49.848">in </span><span begin="00:49.848" end="00:50.137">the </span><span begin="00:50.137" end="00:51.432">corner</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.666" end="00:55.249"><span begin="00:51.666" end="00:51.920">And </span><span begin="00:51.920" end="00:52.384">you </span><span begin="00:52.384" end="00:53.272">can't </span><span begin="00:54.272" end="00:54.537">ignore </span><span begin="00:54.537" end="00:55.249">her</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.880" end="00:59.384"><span begin="00:55.880" end="00:56.088">There </span><span begin="00:56.088" end="00:56.448">must </span><span begin="00:56.448" end="00:57.080">be </span><span begin="00:57.512" end="00:57.912">a </span><span begin="00:57.912" end="00:59.384">reason</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.057" end="01:01.984"><span begin="01:00.057" end="01:00.208">You </span><span begin="01:00.208" end="01:00.448">see </span><span begin="01:00.448" end="01:00.736">it </span><span begin="01:00.736" end="01:01.144">believe </span><span begin="01:01.144" end="01:01.520">it </span><span begin="01:01.520" end="01:01.984">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.032" end="01:05.264"><span begin="01:03.032" end="01:03.320">Search </span><span begin="01:03.320" end="01:03.577">the </span><span begin="01:03.577" end="01:04.448">definition </span><span begin="01:04.448" end="01